      <Article>
        <ArticleTitle>Deep Neural Networks for Medical Image Analysis</ArticleTitle>
        <Abstract>
          <AbstractText Label="BACKGROUND">Medical imaging has benefited enormously from deep learning advances.</AbstractText>
          <AbstractText Label="METHODS">We evaluate convolutional neural networks on three imaging modalities.</AbstractText>
          <AbstractText Label="RESULTS">CNNs outperform radiologists on chest X-ray classification with 95% accuracy.</AbstractText>
          <AbstractText Label="CONCLUSIONS">Deep learning is ready for clinical deployment in radiology.</AbstractText>
        </Abstract>
